<title>POLAND: NBP SELLS PLN 300 MLN OF 182-DAY NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP SELLS PLN 300 MLN OF 182-DAY NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 300 million zlotys of its 182-day NBP-bills, the amount on offer, after banks bid for 323 million worth of the bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The average accepted rate was 21.95 percent, up from 21.33 percent on the last auction on December 27, 1996.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
